{"4460500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Cleanup", "steam_appid": 4460500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/a19c8df33502e4e1828c8ba64939584c.avif?t=1785998819\" width=811 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Crew. You are a contracted janitor for the cleanup initiative. Your job is simple: enter abandoned, hazard-filled facilities, tidy up the mess, and try not to become part of it. This is a co-op horror game for 1-4 players. The shift must be completed, and the company expects perfection. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/75fcd32fab9c2d6cec9dccf72925b1c3.poster.avif?t=1785998819\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/75fcd32fab9c2d6cec9dccf72925b1c3.webm?t=1785998819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/75fcd32fab9c2d6cec9dccf72925b1c3.mp4?t=1785998819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/6073c986605548859b434bc0fd9ce847.avif?t=1785998819\" width=811 height=78 /></span>Grab your gear and get to cleaning. Just don't get too comfortable when you hear a familiar voice in the dark. Malicious mimics lurk in the shadows, perfectly imitating your crew-mates to lure you into a trap. Look closely, listen carefully, and remember: real friends don't walk like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/43a83a32b16a49f86b69ec19db30cd5d.poster.avif?t=1785998819\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/43a83a32b16a49f86b69ec19db30cd5d.webm?t=1785998819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/43a83a32b16a49f86b69ec19db30cd5d.mp4?t=1785998819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/4feea93ebfa74ac295afd39e93e5ecff.avif?t=1785998819\" width=811 height=78 /></span> A Hostile Work Environment: You are not alone in the dark. Malicious entities lurk in the shadows, waiting for a single mistake. Learn their behaviors, avoid their gaze, and whatever you do—don't panic. Panic ruins productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/ebbc911c68a960ffe1262905cdceffd6.poster.avif?t=1785998819\" width=780 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/ebbc911c68a960ffe1262905cdceffd6.webm?t=1785998819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/ebbc911c68a960ffe1262905cdceffd6.mp4?t=1785998819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4460500/extras/73a92793074176d6e4a1a219f9f62c50.avif?t=1785998819\" width=811 height=78 /></span>Hear your friends scream in crystal-clear, high-quality audio. Proximity voice chat ensure